| LinuxPrint: Configure's plug-in for printing on RISC OS on Linux
| (rol-print, the Linux side, writes <LinuxPrint$Path>Printers and Log, and
| reads <LinuxPrint$Path>config and request; LinuxPrint$Path is
| IXFS:$.riscos.print. if unset)
Set LinuxPrint$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <LinuxPrint$Dir>.!Sprites
WimpSlot -min 192k -max 192k
BASIC -quit <LinuxPrint$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
